      "claim": "L4 nilotinib Caco-2-derived human effective permeability of about 1.5e-4 cm/s (C139) indicates good intestinal permeability for the pyrimidine-aniline kinase-inhibitor class, consistent with nilotinib's accepted fasted F of 31%.",
      "card_ids": ["C139", "C10"]
